5 null [line 2, column 13] a function is not data: a brush file holds only values
6 null the file holds too much data (more than 200000 values)
7 null [line 3, column 1] syntax error: expected an expression, got end of input
8 null not a .lzbrush file: it should start with the line -~> lzbrush 1
9 null this .lzbrush file is version 2; this Linkz reads version 1
10 null not a .lzbrush file: it should start with the line -~> lzbrush 1
11 null let brush must be a hash {...}
12 null a .lzbrush file is the header line and one line, let brush = ...
13 null not a .lzbrush file: it should start with the line -~> lzbrush 1
brush 1 is not a hash {...}
